 无\n\n角色： 无\n\n画面描述： 画面渐黑，出现字幕。\n六宫格分镜图（每个格子比例 32:27, 2行3列均匀网格）", 2073724140, "randomize", "16:9", "2k", "Third-party", false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 19, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 20, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "link": 24, "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "link": 25, "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "link": 26, "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "link": 27, "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "link": 28, "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "link": 29, "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "link": 30, "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image9", "link": 31, "label": "image9", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image9"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 23, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "shape": 7, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspectRatio"}, "shape": 7, "name": "aspectRatio", "label": "aspectRatio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspectRatio"}, {"widget": {"name": "resolution"}, "shape": 7, "name": "resolution", "label": "resolution", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "resolution"}, {"widget": {"name": "channel"}, "shape": 7, "name": "channel", "label": "channel", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "channel"}, {"widget": {"name": "skip_error"}, "shape": 7, "name": "skip_error", "label": "skip_error", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localize